OL,3,GNEWSAOpponents kick up a stink as
OL,4,Abiogas plans approved
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe development will process up to
OL,7,F120,000 tonnes of chicken waste and
OL,8,Fother material each year to produce
OL,9,Fbiogas.
OL,11,FThe firm said it had worked closely
OL,12,Fwith Lincolnshire County Council and
OL,13,Fhad "robust controls" to protect
OL,14,Fresidents' quality of life.
